    dict(key='11-act-3-figure', kind='figure', title='Four algorithms, one interface',
         body='four_algorithms',
         narration='The library has four slow algorithms. [[slnc 300]] Bcrypt, P B K D F two, scrypt, and Argon two. [[slnc 600]] Before hashing, the same password goes into each: welcome one. [[slnc 600]] After hashing, bcrypt writes its cost, ten, at the front. [[slnc 300]] P B K D F two keeps its settings in the code. [[slnc 300]] Scrypt packs them into one number. [[slnc 300]] And Argon two writes them out in words: sixteen thousand three hundred and eighty four kibibytes of memory, two passes, and one lane. [[slnc 600]] All four use the same two calls, encode and matches. [[slnc 300]] So swapping one for another is a one line change.'),
